  "persona": "",
  "subject": "an auntie who haggles across three towns' secondhand shops for one used washing machine, gets it home for 3,500 with a free hose, and on its first spin cycle it walks across the kitchen while her husband, son and daughter chase it, until the daughter sits on it and her husband wedges a wood chip under its short leg",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Ghanaian highlife in the classic guitar-band style. Two interlocking clean palm-wine highlife guitars picking bright ostinatos; congas and a steady bell pattern; a trumpet and tenor sax horn riff between lines; round melodic electric bass. Open, sun-warm live-band mix with the guitars high and clean. A warm female alto singing brassy and amused, with a call-and-response group answer on the chorus. 118 BPM, D major. Sunny, brassy and giddy. No Afrobeats log drum, no amapiano, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM synths.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n舊貨仔店 我行過三个庄\n頭一間喊八千 我越頭就走\n第二間五千 門蓋仔關袂密\n第三間的頭家 予我講甲頭殼疼\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n三千五 閣送一條水管\n我叫阮翁 去借鐵牛仔來載\n\n[Chorus]\n洗衫機 洗衫機 載轉來囉\n三千五 規庄上俗的寶\n洗衫機 洗衫機 好物無貴\n規家伙仔 攏出來共你迎\n\n[Verse]\n扛入灶跤 插電 衫褲囥落去\n囡仔圍咧看 親像咧看電影\n水放滇 伊踅甲真好聽\n脫水一開 伊煞跳起來\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n喀喀喀 愈搖愈大力\n對灶跤 一步一步行出去\n\n[Chorus]\n洗衫機 洗衫機 你欲去佗\n阮翁攬你的腰 囝搝你的跤\n洗衫機 洗衫機 莫走傷遠\n規家伙仔 攏咧後壁逐\n\n[Verse]\n行過飯桌 挵著茶鈷\n貓仔驚甲 走去冰箱頂覕\n阮查某囝 規个坐起去頂懸\n伊才乖乖 停佇門口\n\n[Bridge]\n原來是一肢跤 短一屑仔\n阮翁提一塊柴片 塞落去\n\n[Chorus]\n洗衫機 洗衫機 這馬乖矣\n三千五 閣送一場舞\n洗衫機 洗衫機 好物無貴\n規家伙仔 笑甲坐落塗跤\n\n[Outro]\n三千五 閣送一場舞",
